path fill='currentColor' d='M7.28 7.15h1.44v4.55H7.28z'\/>\n\t\t\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><span>Ujnotes<\/span> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Working notes on Notes: Place Type, Base, Billing, and Post.<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Source.<\/strong> Https:\/\/developers.google.com\/places\/android-api\/usage.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/developers.google.com\/places\/android-api\/usage#request-uplift\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Place Type<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/developers.google.com\/android\/reference\/com\/google\/android\/gms\/location\/places\/Place\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInt Var Value.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/developers.google.com\/places\/supported_types#table1\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPer app (not app instance).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Base<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t1 000 requests per 24 hour period.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Billing<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t150 000.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Post<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUplift.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Place picker.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Add place.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf the number of requests exceeds 500 000 per 24 hour period on a regular basis, we consider your app a significant user of the Google Places API for Android. We will be in touch to chat about planning capacity. You don't need to take any action until we contact you.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/developers.google.com\/android-publisher\/quotas?hl=en\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFor the purpose of enforcing this quota, the day ends at midnight Pacific time (UTC-8 when California is on standard time, UTC-7 when California is on daylight time).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAndroid signup.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/developers.google.com\/places\/android-api\/signup\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCert + Package name combination.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/google_api\/places\/notes\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/google_api\/places\/notes\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/programming\/google_api\/places' data-target='computer\/programming\/google_api\/places' data-title='Places'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Places<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}